dsh-inject-head README · Install：The package declares `dsh.bundle.patch`, so it installs as a normal bundle.

```bash
git clone https://github.com/HYBB-rash/dsh-inject-head.git
```

Then point the plugin manager at the cloned directory — `install_bundle` with its absolute path — or add it to `~/.dsh/profiles/<profile>/package.json` by hand:

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "dsh-inject-head": "link:/absolute/path/to/dsh-inject-head"
  },
